01(2)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-10-03","finding":"Required Records Maintained and Made Available - Personnel and Training Records: One out of five staff training records were not avaible for review. The most recent training observed included trainings from 2020.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026504817","violation_type_title":"Required Records Maintained and Made Available - Personnel and Training Records (26 TAC §744.801(2))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-518468-i20220929-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-744-901-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-518468-i20220929","date":"2022-09-29","original_code":"744.901(1)","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-10-03","finding":"Required Personnel Records - Dates of Employment: Three out five staff records did not include a start date for the employee. A personnel form was not avaible for review in order to reflect the employees start date.  One staff added their employment date while Licensing was present.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026344540","violation_type_title":"Required Personnel Records - Dates of Employment (26 TAC §744.901(1))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-518468-i20220929-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-744-1037-a-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-518468-i20220929","date":"2022-09-29","original_code":"744.1037(a)(2)","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-10-05","finding":"Documentation for Directors - Governing Body/Director Designation Form: During the annual monitor inspection, the newly appointed Director had not submitted a Governing Body/Director Designation form to Licensing. Licensing learned during the inspection of the new Site Director position for this location.","topic":"st